ained underwater, and police dive captain Guo Deyou becomes the prime suspect. As the victim’s son, Ding Mao, investigates, more strange drownings occur, forcing him to team up with Guo, a spirit medium, and a journalist. Their search uncovers a dark secret tied to a deadly cult from decades ago, now resurfacing to wreak havoc. Together, they must uncover the truth and stop the rising threat.","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Korean"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGltZS1BZnRlci1UaW1lLSUyOFRWLVNlcmllcy0yMDE3JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Time After Time","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/brQIzcZEa5bSwq84E6b3XNFgiTE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AeIdLX172hgbQOalPNlra32xAuI.jpg","description":"A young H.G. Wells time travels to modern day New York City in pursuit of the charismatic—yet secretly psychopathic—Dr. John Stevenson, better known as \"Jack the Ripper,\" following the doctor's brazen escape from the Victorian London authorities.","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["English"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVGltZS1PdXQtJTI4MjAxNyUyOS8","type":"series","name":"Time Out","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/9nvYx9PfQCLssAKbkA4hIH85o9B.jpg","description":"Rahul and Radha seem to have it all - a happy marriage, a decent job and a beautiful house! But what happens when Radha's pregnancy's announcement makes Rahul realise that he's been living the life he's supposed to and not necessarily the one he wants to? Can a partner hit pause on a seemingly perfect life and revaluate his choices? And what about Radha? Is she just a collateral damage to Rahul's early mid life crisis? Watch our newest Voot Original, Time Out.","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Hindi"]},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvVGluLVN0YXItJTI4VFYtU2VyaWVzLTIwMTctJTI5LTEwODBwLw","type":"series","name":"Tin Star 1080p","description